WEBVTT

01:30.860 --> 01:34.970
[Legend of the Magnate]

01:35.020 --> 01:37.870
[Episode 8]

01:38.560 --> 01:39.840
Do you know who he is?

01:41.229 --> 01:44.229
He is the greatest warrior
of the Qing Empire,

01:44.590 --> 01:46.200
the commander of the Bao Regiment,

01:46.200 --> 01:47.789
Bao Qingde.

01:49.280 --> 01:51.350
He came here specifically

01:51.370 --> 01:53.970
to thank Mr. Gu.

01:54.710 --> 01:57.640
He deposited all of Pingyao's

01:57.759 --> 02:00.670
allocated funds in Wanyuan Bank.

02:01.680 --> 02:03.270
Even

02:03.680 --> 02:04.970
the provincial governor's office
wouldn't dare

02:04.970 --> 02:07.170
ask a single question about that money.

02:10.330 --> 02:12.430
It seems Li Baiwan

02:12.910 --> 02:14.930
really has

02:15.070 --> 02:17.230
put down roots in Pingyao.

02:18.710 --> 02:21.140
He should thank you three.

02:24.680 --> 02:25.210
Boss!

02:25.240 --> 02:27.380
That wasn't our intention.

02:27.440 --> 02:28.510
Stop it.

02:29.470 --> 02:30.400
I don't care

02:30.400 --> 02:32.130
if it was your intention or not.

02:34.079 --> 02:35.190
It was you three

02:35.210 --> 02:37.400
who drove him away.

02:37.910 --> 02:40.000
And this is the result.

02:51.040 --> 02:52.190
If you three

02:52.780 --> 02:55.079
still want to stay in this business,

02:55.960 --> 02:57.560
go home,

02:57.579 --> 02:59.740
think carefully,

03:00.150 --> 03:01.800
review your accounts thoroughly,

03:01.800 --> 03:03.860
and then come to me for verification.

03:04.120 --> 03:06.310
If you can explain

03:07.800 --> 03:09.430
every account clearly,

03:10.200 --> 03:12.600
I might be able
to help you think of a way out.

03:12.910 --> 03:14.240
If you can't,

03:16.520 --> 03:17.520
then go home

03:18.750 --> 03:20.630
and be prepare to live a hard life

03:20.960 --> 03:23.150
with your children.

03:38.430 --> 03:40.630
Like smashing soybeans on a stone slab—

03:40.910 --> 03:42.370
it's a head-on collision.

03:42.590 --> 03:44.430
You two have turned

03:44.560 --> 03:46.160
the entire city upside down.

03:47.120 --> 03:48.540
Not quite upside down.

03:48.680 --> 03:50.590
We just poked a hole in it.

03:50.710 --> 03:52.000
This Mr. Gu

03:52.280 --> 03:53.560
does business the way

03:53.630 --> 03:55.030
a general commands troops.

03:55.030 --> 03:55.750
Honestly,

03:56.150 --> 03:58.079
I was really nervous a few days ago.

03:58.430 --> 03:59.630
We spent money renting those warehouses,

03:59.630 --> 04:00.760
and inside were just

04:00.800 --> 04:01.520
pots and pans

04:01.520 --> 04:02.630
and a pile of broken water jars.

04:02.630 --> 04:04.290
It was absolutely killing me.

04:04.710 --> 04:06.770
You're absolutely right about that.

04:07.400 --> 04:08.110
Gu,

04:08.240 --> 04:09.280
think about it.

04:09.960 --> 04:10.750
I, Bao,

04:10.840 --> 04:12.710
risk my life on the battlefield.

04:13.630 --> 04:14.620
If someone

04:14.800 --> 04:15.800
chops off

04:15.840 --> 04:17.040
my head,

04:18.360 --> 04:19.820
wouldn't your 1,000 taels

04:20.120 --> 04:21.430
be wasted?

04:25.270 --> 04:26.000
Say it!

04:26.560 --> 04:27.560
Be honest with me!

04:28.070 --> 04:29.920
General Bao, someone like you,

04:30.030 --> 04:31.330
wearing a Imperial Yellow Jacket

04:31.330 --> 04:32.630
and carrying a waist sword,

04:32.630 --> 04:34.490
is worth far more than 1000 taels.

04:34.630 --> 04:35.770
Forgive me for saying this,

04:35.770 --> 04:37.650
but if you were to die for our country,

04:37.650 --> 04:38.390
I could take your

04:38.390 --> 04:39.870
Imperial Yellow Jacket and waist knife

04:39.870 --> 04:41.240
to the Marshal's camp.

04:41.780 --> 04:42.680
Even if I asked

04:42.680 --> 04:44.430
for two or three thousand taels,

04:44.430 --> 04:46.630
the Marshal would have to buy them back.

04:47.750 --> 04:48.280
Cunning!

04:48.630 --> 04:49.159
Cunning.

04:49.400 --> 04:50.600
Very cunning indeed!

04:51.000 --> 04:52.360
You two young fellows

04:52.409 --> 04:53.830
are truly something.

04:54.190 --> 04:54.920
I can now say

04:54.940 --> 04:56.930
I've seen true heroes

04:57.240 --> 04:58.700
and haven't lived in vain!

05:12.190 --> 05:13.050
Do you think...

05:13.460 --> 05:14.920
that by stirring things up

05:15.060 --> 05:16.790
and punching a hole in Pingyao,

05:17.360 --> 05:19.110
you can get yourself out of trouble now?

05:19.110 --> 05:20.170
Get out of trouble?

05:20.950 --> 05:22.850
As long as my case isn't dismissed,

05:22.850 --> 05:23.750
no matter where I go,

05:23.750 --> 05:25.150
I'll still be a criminal.

05:27.070 --> 05:27.630
If I could

05:27.630 --> 05:29.830
get those who
got involved because of me out of this,

05:29.830 --> 05:31.370
I wouldn't mind dying.

05:32.390 --> 05:33.590
Don't talk nonsense.

05:34.240 --> 05:35.070
If nothing else works,

05:35.070 --> 05:36.670
come back to Beijing with me.

05:36.870 --> 05:38.470
My father may know what to do.

05:38.630 --> 05:39.800
The name Li Baiwan

05:39.830 --> 05:40.960
isn't just for show.

05:41.430 --> 05:43.320
He knows so many ministers and nobles.

05:43.320 --> 05:44.530
Helping you clear your name

05:44.530 --> 05:45.860
wouldn't be difficult.

05:46.070 --> 05:46.730
At worst...

05:47.920 --> 05:49.650
At worst, I'd kneel and beg him.

05:50.770 --> 05:52.360
A man's dignity is worth more than gold.

05:52.360 --> 05:53.490
How can you say that?

05:53.830 --> 05:55.120
Doing business with you

05:55.120 --> 05:56.780
gives me great satisfaction.

05:56.950 --> 05:58.720
If you get caught by the government,

05:58.720 --> 05:59.980
they'll send you back.

06:04.190 --> 06:06.450
You'd better keep your distance from me.

06:09.840 --> 06:11.360
Do you know who I really am?

06:13.480 --> 06:15.680
Do you know what crimes I've committed?

06:16.420 --> 06:18.150
Everyone who's been close to me

06:18.510 --> 06:20.910
has already been implicated because of me.

06:22.810 --> 06:23.630
We should

06:24.040 --> 06:25.120
go our separate ways

06:25.120 --> 06:25.850
from now on.

06:27.570 --> 06:28.430
Actually,

06:28.640 --> 06:29.190
the reason I stirred you up

06:29.190 --> 06:30.720
to cause so much trouble was

06:31.070 --> 06:32.930
simply so we could use each other.

06:33.110 --> 06:35.280
You could establish yourself in Shanxi,

06:35.280 --> 06:36.159
and I

06:37.060 --> 06:38.190
could save the people

06:38.190 --> 06:39.120
I wanted to save.

06:39.310 --> 06:40.400
That's all.

06:41.890 --> 06:43.130
As for being friends,

06:44.050 --> 06:45.250
I don't deserve that.

06:48.570 --> 06:49.720
I'll be going now,

06:50.450 --> 06:51.360
Mr. Li Qin.

06:54.430 --> 06:55.120
Gu...

07:07.510 --> 07:08.240
You're here.

07:08.630 --> 07:09.240
Come.

07:09.560 --> 07:10.360
Sit down.

07:11.040 --> 07:12.310
I came for Mr. Chang.

07:13.040 --> 07:14.700
You want that mansion, right?

07:14.800 --> 07:15.720
Take it.

07:17.520 --> 07:18.920
I even brought the deed.

07:20.160 --> 07:20.880
Today,

07:21.310 --> 07:23.260
I also helped you
foil the pawnshop's scheme.

07:23.260 --> 07:25.790
This deal
can be considered complete, right?

07:28.510 --> 07:29.390
Complete?

07:30.480 --> 07:31.560
Of course it is.

07:32.950 --> 07:34.870
I still have another task for you.

07:37.000 --> 07:38.730
That's not how business works.

07:39.690 --> 07:42.210
How business is done is up to me.

07:43.070 --> 07:45.180
As for Chang Si's house,

07:45.600 --> 07:46.930
I don't want it anymore.

07:48.430 --> 07:50.070
Take back the deed.

07:50.270 --> 07:52.270
Keep it for yourself

07:52.340 --> 07:53.600
or give it to him—

07:54.070 --> 07:56.040
it's a reward for both of you.

07:56.830 --> 07:57.600
However,

07:58.360 --> 07:59.040
I can't

07:59.800 --> 08:00.860
release him.

08:01.560 --> 08:04.090
You still need to help me
with something else.

08:21.560 --> 08:22.720
Have you heard of

08:23.510 --> 08:25.240
King Li's treasure?

08:32.320 --> 08:35.370
It is said that after Li Chuang
captured the capital,

08:35.900 --> 08:37.690
he gathered 70 million taels of silver

08:37.690 --> 08:40.580
under the name of redemption funds.

08:40.960 --> 08:43.309
Later, his army was utterly defeated,

08:43.429 --> 08:44.570
so he abandoned Chang'an

08:44.570 --> 08:45.830
and fled to Hunan and Guangzhou.

08:45.830 --> 08:49.230
When passing through Shanxi,
he was pursued by the Qing army.

08:49.390 --> 08:50.760
To escape,

08:51.180 --> 08:52.200
he abandoned all this silver

08:52.200 --> 08:54.610
in a mountain valley.

08:55.390 --> 08:56.470
In that valley,

08:56.750 --> 08:58.530
there were eight households.

08:58.960 --> 09:01.830
Stumbled upon this windfall,

09:02.720 --> 09:05.520
they began generations
of business from then on.

09:05.870 --> 09:07.810
The Eight Families have stood firm

09:07.870 --> 09:09.410
from the late Ming dynasty to today,

09:09.410 --> 09:10.470
all because

09:10.570 --> 09:13.110
they relied on King Li's Treasure.

09:13.440 --> 09:15.510
No matter what disasters came,

09:15.550 --> 09:18.950
they could turn misfortune into fortune
with this treasure.

09:19.440 --> 09:22.950
Now I want you to get into
the Eight Families

09:23.000 --> 09:25.710
and help me find this treasure.

09:28.720 --> 09:29.320
Look.

09:30.150 --> 09:31.750
Taiyufeng has a new manager.

09:37.360 --> 09:38.970
He looks quite young.

09:41.380 --> 09:43.850
I heard he is a close confidant
of Mr. Wang

09:43.880 --> 09:45.370
and very capable.

09:53.240 --> 09:54.940
The boss of our bank

09:55.000 --> 09:57.180
is personally welcoming the manager.

09:57.390 --> 09:59.590
Manager, please take a seat.

10:09.390 --> 10:11.360
Ledgers Passing!

10:11.670 --> 10:12.770
[Taiyufeng General Ledger]

10:18.660 --> 10:18.990
[Taiyufeng General Ledger]

10:31.600 --> 10:34.000
The manager has checked the ledgers!

10:41.550 --> 10:42.980
Congratulations, Boss!

10:43.120 --> 10:45.540
As all streams flow to the sea,

10:45.750 --> 10:48.150
you've acquired the finest talent
in the land.

10:48.150 --> 10:50.840
You can rest easy from now on.

10:51.030 --> 10:53.150
Congratulations, Boss!

10:55.080 --> 10:57.040
Congratulations, Boss!

10:57.480 --> 10:58.630
-Congratulations!
-Congratulations!

10:58.630 --> 10:59.690
Congratulations!

11:42.270 --> 11:42.840
Heizi,

11:43.390 --> 11:44.990
where have you gone to fight?

11:45.360 --> 11:45.960
Didn't Father say

11:45.960 --> 11:47.200
not to pick fights?

11:49.360 --> 11:49.960
People like me

11:49.960 --> 11:51.200
can only fight.

11:51.240 --> 11:52.570
I'm not as clever as him.

11:53.710 --> 11:55.310
Who made you angry this time?

11:57.910 --> 11:59.360
Taiyufeng
has a new manager starting today.

11:59.360 --> 12:00.090
Did you know?

12:00.380 --> 12:01.030
I don't go out.

12:01.030 --> 12:01.960
How would I know?

12:04.440 --> 12:05.300
The new manager

12:05.550 --> 12:06.980
is Gu Pingyuan, the one our father

12:06.980 --> 12:08.580
saved at the risk of his life.

12:11.840 --> 12:13.570
He's all dressed up and decent,

12:13.670 --> 12:15.320
drinking with the magistrate.

12:15.320 --> 12:16.650
Looking so impressive.

12:17.720 --> 12:19.450
It's true our father saved him.

12:19.510 --> 12:20.970
But he also saved you guys.

12:24.270 --> 12:25.440
He... he is... he...

12:26.890 --> 12:28.120
Can you stop defending him

12:28.120 --> 12:28.850
all the time?

12:29.060 --> 12:29.740
I just feel that

12:29.740 --> 12:31.560
once he got rich, he changed his attitude.

12:31.560 --> 12:32.200
Our father

12:32.200 --> 12:33.260
is still in prison.

12:34.230 --> 12:35.640
Then what do you expect him to do?

12:35.640 --> 12:36.900
Break into the prison?

12:37.150 --> 12:37.670
Heizi,

12:37.960 --> 12:39.720
you wouldn't dare either, right?

12:39.720 --> 12:40.570
Or should he

12:40.630 --> 12:42.030
stay home and cry with me?

12:43.150 --> 12:44.870
It's not as if I'm short of company.

12:44.870 --> 12:45.630
He's a good guy.

12:45.630 --> 12:47.090
He's great. He's the best.

12:47.530 --> 12:49.120
A fugitive, living comfortably

12:49.120 --> 12:50.030
like a big shot,

12:50.360 --> 12:52.000
while our father
spent his whole life helping others

12:52.000 --> 12:53.120
and is now sitting in a cell.

12:53.120 --> 12:54.670
Come with me later to bring him food.

12:54.670 --> 12:56.730
And stop saying such foolish things.

13:03.880 --> 13:07.150
[Shixingdang]

13:05.910 --> 13:07.670
Isn't he from Wanyuandang?

13:10.000 --> 13:12.510
The young master
of the Li family in the capital.

13:12.510 --> 13:13.200
Mr. Li Qin!

13:14.330 --> 13:16.000
What is he doing here?

13:18.870 --> 13:20.300
He's from Wanyuandang,

13:20.350 --> 13:21.030
right?

13:33.850 --> 13:35.870
I didn't get the chance
to congratulate you.

13:35.870 --> 13:36.940
Please forgive me.

13:37.040 --> 13:37.960
Sit down.

13:40.460 --> 13:41.990
Let me introduce everyone.

13:42.010 --> 13:43.050
This is my friend,

13:43.300 --> 13:45.190
Mr. Li Qin, a manager

13:45.750 --> 13:47.600
who works for Li Baiwan in the capital

13:47.600 --> 13:49.200
and the head of Wanyuandang.

13:51.670 --> 13:54.610
This is Li Baiwan's son.

13:59.750 --> 14:00.720
Manager,

14:02.100 --> 14:03.550
since we have such a distinguished guest,

14:03.550 --> 14:05.540
shouldn't you introduce him to us?

14:05.840 --> 14:07.150
This is the head of Wanyuandang,

14:07.150 --> 14:07.790
Mr. Li Qin.

14:08.550 --> 14:09.610
And this is my boss,

14:09.630 --> 14:10.360
Mr. Wang.

14:10.530 --> 14:11.520
Old Mr. Wang,

14:11.750 --> 14:13.010
I've long admired you.

14:13.070 --> 14:14.250
You flatter me.

14:14.510 --> 14:15.960
I am Wang Tiangui,

14:16.120 --> 14:17.250
and I'm not that old.

14:18.080 --> 14:19.860
What a decent young man.

14:22.440 --> 14:24.210
I heard you're the young man

14:24.270 --> 14:26.840
who drove my pawnshop and draft bank

14:27.150 --> 14:28.760
into the red

14:28.790 --> 14:30.000
and thrown

14:30.000 --> 14:31.600
the entire Pingyao

14:31.670 --> 14:33.080
into complete chaos.

14:34.630 --> 14:35.240
Kid,

14:35.440 --> 14:36.340
look around.

14:36.440 --> 14:38.360
See how these people can hardly wait

14:38.360 --> 14:40.600
to eat you alive?

14:41.440 --> 14:42.240
Mr. Wang,

14:42.510 --> 14:43.680
I wouldn't dare.

14:44.000 --> 14:46.470
I only seek a place to stand.

14:46.870 --> 14:49.400
I came here
as a student to learn the trade.

14:50.960 --> 14:52.020
A student, you say?

14:52.720 --> 14:53.320
Very well.

14:53.600 --> 14:54.840
Move this stool over

14:54.910 --> 14:55.670
today,

14:56.240 --> 14:57.030
and you'll have your place

14:57.030 --> 14:58.390
in Pingyao.

15:00.320 --> 15:01.920
But remember,

15:02.240 --> 15:03.560
those little tricks—

15:03.600 --> 15:05.330
you'd better stop them, right?

15:05.440 --> 15:06.240
Of course.

15:08.010 --> 15:09.480
I apologize if I've offended you.

15:09.480 --> 15:11.120
Please forgive me.

15:11.200 --> 15:11.840
From now on,

15:11.840 --> 15:13.510
I will listen to Mr. Wang

15:13.840 --> 15:15.680
and put an end

15:15.960 --> 15:17.090
to all those antics.

15:21.080 --> 15:22.460
Enjoy.

15:22.630 --> 15:24.160
There's more if you need it.

15:30.270 --> 15:32.260
Something interesting happened recently.

15:32.260 --> 15:34.220
Dozens of appraisers have come to Pingyao.

15:34.220 --> 15:36.350
What do you think they're here for?

15:37.480 --> 15:39.080
Dozens of appraisers and managers

15:39.080 --> 15:40.080
suddenly came to Pingyao,

15:40.080 --> 15:41.200
this small county.

15:42.360 --> 15:43.080
I'm afraid

15:43.150 --> 15:44.410
Ms. Su, the one close to you,

15:44.410 --> 15:45.470
is behind it.

16:00.440 --> 16:01.390
It's my honor

16:01.390 --> 16:02.790
to have you all here

16:03.000 --> 16:04.080
in Pingyao.

16:05.060 --> 16:06.290
Everyone present

16:06.670 --> 16:08.420
is among the most senior

16:08.480 --> 16:10.060
pawnshop appraisers

16:10.150 --> 16:11.580
and draft bank managers in Shanxi.

16:11.580 --> 16:13.600
You rarely step out of your doors.

16:14.890 --> 16:16.410
A toast to you.

16:28.390 --> 16:30.240
Why are my family in Nanjing?

16:30.870 --> 16:32.480
What's going on here?

16:32.580 --> 16:33.350
Really?

16:33.370 --> 16:34.770
What's written on yours?

16:35.620 --> 16:36.360
When I left home,

16:36.360 --> 16:37.480
everything was fine.

16:37.480 --> 16:38.240
Really?

16:38.260 --> 16:39.590
-Yeah.
-What happened?

16:39.840 --> 16:40.580
Who did this?

16:40.600 --> 16:41.460
I've paid you well

16:41.460 --> 16:42.820
to come.

16:44.720 --> 16:47.190
If you want to know how big this deal is—

16:47.840 --> 16:48.750
well,

16:49.440 --> 16:50.270
it's a big one.

16:51.810 --> 16:52.790
In business,

16:53.390 --> 16:54.890
some pursue wealth,

16:54.920 --> 16:56.200
some pursue fame.

16:56.320 --> 16:57.520
I pursue the country.

16:59.270 --> 17:00.470
I come from the south.

17:01.390 --> 17:02.320
The south?

17:02.360 --> 17:03.670
None of you in this room

17:03.960 --> 17:06.020
can escape

17:06.400 --> 17:07.510
the charge of

17:07.829 --> 17:09.660
colluding with the enemy.

17:15.109 --> 17:15.640
Here.

17:16.640 --> 17:18.030
Here's to

17:18.220 --> 17:19.310
this accusation.

17:20.440 --> 17:21.700
Let's drink together.

17:37.030 --> 17:37.790
Bro,

17:38.950 --> 17:40.350
this woman is not simple.

17:40.620 --> 17:41.680
Stay away from her.

17:42.510 --> 17:43.170
Otherwise,

17:43.400 --> 17:45.730
it could bring disaster
to your whole family.

17:45.730 --> 17:48.190
I've wanted to tell my father
the same thing,

17:48.310 --> 17:49.480
but he won't listen.

17:51.720 --> 17:52.580
What about you?

17:53.030 --> 17:53.830
What about me?

17:54.420 --> 17:55.200
You're now

17:55.200 --> 17:56.560
the manager of Taiyufeng—

17:56.560 --> 17:59.260
[Taiyufeng]

17:57.200 --> 17:58.750
a position so many envy.

17:59.720 --> 18:01.310
Apart from the Eight Families in Hedong,

18:01.310 --> 18:02.830
the most powerful in this region

18:02.830 --> 18:04.420
is your Mr. Wang.

18:05.480 --> 18:06.880
So now that you've taken this post,

18:06.880 --> 18:08.510
are you going to follow its rules

18:08.510 --> 18:09.440
and start opposing me

18:09.440 --> 18:10.880
from now on?

18:11.400 --> 18:12.730
I'm just playing along,

18:12.920 --> 18:13.750
nothing more.

18:16.200 --> 18:16.960
Why don't you

18:17.400 --> 18:18.860
just resign your position

18:18.920 --> 18:20.720
and come work at my Wanyuandang?

18:21.110 --> 18:22.640
Or I could write to my father

18:22.680 --> 18:24.000
and have the charges against you dropped.

18:24.000 --> 18:25.000
Anyway, as long as you

18:25.000 --> 18:26.270
remain manager here for a day,

18:26.270 --> 18:27.870
I won't feel at ease for a day.

18:28.440 --> 18:29.110
Wanyuandang

18:29.110 --> 18:30.510
doesn't want an enemy like you.

18:30.510 --> 18:31.270
I also don't want

18:31.270 --> 18:32.270
an enemy like you.

18:34.030 --> 18:35.690
I appreciate your kind offer.

18:36.000 --> 18:36.640
But right now,

18:36.640 --> 18:38.750
I still have some unfinished business.

18:38.750 --> 18:40.510
If one day
I find myself with nowhere to turn,

18:40.510 --> 18:42.040
don't forget what you said.

18:47.720 --> 18:49.160
The country is divided in two,

18:49.160 --> 18:51.070
and the Resistance Army
already controls half.

18:51.070 --> 18:53.070
Jiangnan is the wealthiest region,

18:53.400 --> 18:55.030
but after years of war

18:55.640 --> 18:57.040
and all its ups and downs,

18:57.240 --> 18:58.960
even the banks and pawnshops in Nanjing

18:58.960 --> 19:00.200
are completely gone.

19:00.960 --> 19:02.160
And there's Zhejiang,

19:02.160 --> 19:03.640
Suzhou, Yangzhou,

19:03.680 --> 19:04.830
Zhenjiang, Ningbo—

19:05.070 --> 19:06.310
which of these places

19:06.350 --> 19:07.810
wasn't rolling in wealth?

19:07.920 --> 19:09.310
Now they're all barren.

19:11.400 --> 19:12.590
The Resistance Army intends

19:12.590 --> 19:14.160
to reorganize Jiangnan's finances

19:14.160 --> 19:15.620
and get commerce flowing,

19:16.230 --> 19:18.440
but many of those skilled
in running draft banks and pawnshops

19:18.440 --> 19:19.310
have either died or fled.

19:19.310 --> 19:21.400
For a time, we couldn't find many of them.

19:21.400 --> 19:23.070
That's why I invited you here.

19:26.240 --> 19:27.830
Those of you who are willing to go south

19:27.830 --> 19:29.000
to make a living—

19:29.430 --> 19:30.790
I can help

19:31.550 --> 19:33.210
send your families to Nanjing

19:33.790 --> 19:34.920
and settle them properly

19:34.920 --> 19:36.180
with absolute safety.

19:36.720 --> 19:37.900
Once you're there,

19:38.440 --> 19:40.600
you can choose good shops

19:40.680 --> 19:42.080
and capable assistants,

19:42.160 --> 19:44.620
reopen the banks,
and run your own business.

19:44.680 --> 19:46.790
The initial funds
will be provided by the Resistance Army.

19:46.790 --> 19:48.400
And your descendants
can take the imperial exams

19:48.400 --> 19:49.920
and become officials in the south.

19:49.920 --> 19:51.070
Those who do well

19:51.240 --> 19:52.900
might even earn a noble title.

19:53.680 --> 19:55.150
That makes some sense.

19:55.240 --> 19:56.850
In these turbulent times,

19:56.870 --> 19:58.440
could such a good opportunity
really exist?

19:58.440 --> 19:59.480
If it's true...

19:59.660 --> 20:01.010
I guarantee you

20:01.440 --> 20:02.570
that within 3 years,

20:02.750 --> 20:04.680
money will be flowing in the south.

20:05.880 --> 20:06.890
After 3 years,

20:07.470 --> 20:09.930
if you want to stay in the south,
you can stay,

20:10.270 --> 20:11.510
and if you want to come back,

20:11.510 --> 20:12.700
I can make that

20:12.750 --> 20:13.510
happen too.

20:14.490 --> 20:17.340
[Li Mansion]

20:17.040 --> 20:17.960
Why didn't you tell me about

20:17.960 --> 20:19.720
such a major matter
as the allocated funds?

20:19.720 --> 20:21.550
I only just received the news.

20:21.750 --> 20:22.680
General Bao Qingde

20:22.680 --> 20:24.400
has given all the allocated funds
of Pingyao

20:24.400 --> 20:26.030
to Young Master's bank—

20:26.830 --> 20:29.490
millions of taels of military funds
every year.

20:29.750 --> 20:31.350
Those draft banks in Pingyao

20:31.830 --> 20:33.230
are absolutely jealous.

20:34.510 --> 20:35.630
This kid.

20:35.660 --> 20:36.960
He only focuses on business

20:36.960 --> 20:39.020
without leaving himself any way out.

20:39.160 --> 20:40.240
You yourself said

20:40.310 --> 20:42.480
that no one in this world
gives way to others.

20:42.480 --> 20:43.500
Whether it's storefront pawning,

20:43.500 --> 20:44.350
door-to-door pawning,

20:44.350 --> 20:45.480
or clergy-oriented pawning,

20:45.480 --> 20:46.610
without such a reputation,

20:46.610 --> 20:48.480
how could anyone land a deal like this?

20:48.480 --> 20:49.080
In ancient times, a man offered

20:49.080 --> 20:49.720
1000 gold coins
to buy a horse's corpse to show sincerity.

20:49.720 --> 20:50.920
In less than a month, Young Master

20:50.920 --> 20:51.920
achieved so much.

20:51.920 --> 20:53.180
You should praise him.

20:53.350 --> 20:54.440
Praise him?

20:55.200 --> 20:56.550
This is a victorious start.

20:56.550 --> 20:57.480
Don't you think?

20:59.240 --> 21:00.110
That's true.

21:00.510 --> 21:01.750
He hasn't been in Shanxi long

21:01.750 --> 21:03.110
and has already made such a breakthrough.

21:03.110 --> 21:04.440
It's truly remarkable.

21:05.310 --> 21:06.040
Can I say this

21:06.480 --> 21:07.550
to Young Master?

21:07.830 --> 21:09.490
Don't praise your own people.

21:10.750 --> 21:13.330
Any other news from Shanxi?

21:14.640 --> 21:16.680
Young Master wrote that that Gu fellow

21:16.680 --> 21:18.200
has already returned to the pawnshop.

21:18.200 --> 21:20.730
They've each settled
in their positions now.

21:25.590 --> 21:26.400
How should we

21:26.570 --> 21:27.830
reply to Young Master?

21:28.200 --> 21:29.460
Write back and tell him

21:29.480 --> 21:31.180
that friends in business

21:31.240 --> 21:33.070
are the least trustworthy people

21:33.070 --> 21:34.250
in the world.

21:37.310 --> 21:38.000
Boss.

21:43.160 --> 21:43.820
Forgive me.

21:44.350 --> 21:46.830
How does it feel to be

21:47.680 --> 21:49.310
the manager of Taiyufeng?

21:51.880 --> 21:54.070
My position is precarious.

21:54.750 --> 21:56.350
I just perform whatever role

21:56.440 --> 21:57.510
you assign me.

21:58.960 --> 22:00.110
Are you

22:00.640 --> 22:03.110
interested in Chang Si's daughter?

22:05.920 --> 22:07.270
How could you say that?

22:08.200 --> 22:09.160
What's my status now?

22:09.160 --> 22:10.270
And what's hers?

22:10.870 --> 22:12.670
How could I be interested in her?

22:16.440 --> 22:18.880
It doesn't matter if you are.

22:19.590 --> 22:21.160
You're now

22:21.400 --> 22:23.750
the manager of Taiyufeng.

22:24.030 --> 22:26.830
You can afford to spend lavishly.

22:29.590 --> 22:31.720
I'll give you wealth and honor.

22:32.220 --> 22:33.160
Do you want it?

22:33.900 --> 22:35.400
You know where I came from.

22:36.240 --> 22:36.960
The people locked up there

22:36.960 --> 22:38.160
are all men of wealth.

22:38.550 --> 22:39.950
That taught me one thing:

22:41.270 --> 22:42.400
in this world,

22:42.710 --> 22:43.310
nothing matters

22:43.310 --> 22:44.680
more than staying safe.

22:56.790 --> 22:58.200
In 10 days,

22:58.740 --> 23:01.830
representatives of the Eight Families
will gather at Jinyang Villa.

23:01.830 --> 23:03.160
Among these Eight Families

23:03.160 --> 23:04.830
is the Kang family.

23:05.920 --> 23:09.110
They lost His Highness's
military supplies.

23:09.190 --> 23:11.190
The imperial court is furious.

23:11.400 --> 23:13.860
This time they will definitely
punish them.

23:14.510 --> 23:15.510
The Kang family

23:15.550 --> 23:17.680
has been in bodyguard business
for generations

23:17.680 --> 23:19.310
and is very wealthy,

23:19.920 --> 23:21.110
but now

23:21.680 --> 23:24.480
they have no choice
but to sell off their property.

23:25.240 --> 23:27.440
Do you think they're selling property?

23:27.640 --> 23:30.040
What they're selling is their family name.

23:32.210 --> 23:33.880
I understand what you mean.

23:34.920 --> 23:36.480
You want to go all in—

23:36.960 --> 23:38.290
buy out the Kang family,

23:39.240 --> 23:40.700
enter the Eight Families,

23:41.550 --> 23:43.160
and get your share

23:43.270 --> 23:44.530
of King Li's Treasure.

23:49.030 --> 23:50.320
But even if you know

23:50.350 --> 23:51.960
where the treasure is,

23:52.510 --> 23:54.040
what could you possibly do?

23:54.580 --> 23:55.440
After all, that treasure

23:55.440 --> 23:57.970
is jointly controlled
by the Eight Families.

24:03.140 --> 24:04.790
People say you're a nerd,

24:04.830 --> 24:06.780
and you really are.

24:07.260 --> 24:09.180
What is money?

24:10.110 --> 24:12.610
A small amount of money
can reach the gods,

24:12.880 --> 24:14.030
and a vast amount

24:14.830 --> 24:16.710
is the god itself!

24:28.270 --> 24:29.310
Ms. Yu'er.

24:33.750 --> 24:34.880
Where are you going?

24:35.000 --> 24:35.880
Don't touch me.

24:41.920 --> 24:42.920
It's getting cold.

24:42.920 --> 24:43.450
Put it on.

24:49.350 --> 24:50.880
Did my clothing offend you?

24:52.070 --> 24:53.960
You look quite pleased with yourself.

24:53.960 --> 24:55.560
I haven't seen you in so long.

24:57.270 --> 24:58.400
Mr. Chang is in jail.

24:58.420 --> 24:59.350
I'm worried too.

25:00.200 --> 25:02.160
But what good would it do
for me to go back?

25:02.160 --> 25:04.020
Should I cry with you face to face?

25:05.850 --> 25:07.310
But you still didn't come,

25:07.750 --> 25:09.610
leaving me there guessing alone.

25:10.030 --> 25:10.590
Heizi—

25:10.680 --> 25:11.450
you know him.

25:11.550 --> 25:13.410
He never thinks before he speaks.

25:14.880 --> 25:16.900
You look drunk,

25:17.590 --> 25:19.590
not at all like someone about to cry.

25:20.160 --> 25:20.830
What?

25:21.030 --> 25:21.960
In your eyes,

25:21.980 --> 25:24.240
am I someone who only cares about wealth?

25:24.680 --> 25:26.640
You think I want to be in a foreign place?

25:26.640 --> 25:27.590
You think I want to be this

25:27.590 --> 25:28.720
puppet manager?

25:29.810 --> 25:31.480
How is Pingyao a foreign place?

25:31.480 --> 25:32.960
I was born here.

25:32.960 --> 25:33.350
I...

25:35.510 --> 25:37.000
I mean...

25:38.920 --> 25:39.920
my home is in Huizhou,

25:39.920 --> 25:41.180
and now I can't go back.

25:42.400 --> 25:44.930
So I can't fulfill my filial duty
to my mother.

25:45.480 --> 25:46.830
So for me, Pingyao

25:47.160 --> 25:49.200
is indeed a foreign place.

25:51.180 --> 25:53.180
You're always so clever with words.

25:53.200 --> 25:55.180
Anyway, nothing I say seems right.

26:01.400 --> 26:03.030
You're driving me crazy.

26:04.310 --> 26:05.550
My father is sick,

26:05.640 --> 26:07.270
sometimes better, sometimes worse.

26:07.270 --> 26:09.250
He lives there without sunlight.

26:09.550 --> 26:11.920
Though he's treated
better than other convicts,

26:11.920 --> 26:13.270
it's still a prison.

26:13.590 --> 26:14.740
I told him to rest well,

26:14.740 --> 26:16.470
yet he asks about you every day.

26:16.510 --> 26:17.960
How am I supposed to answer that?

26:17.960 --> 26:19.820
Tell him you're a big manager now,

26:19.830 --> 26:21.400
dressing all fancy every day

26:21.400 --> 26:23.150
and wearing a big black cloak?

26:23.240 --> 26:24.640
Just tell Mr. Chang that.

26:25.440 --> 26:26.640
See if he believes it.

26:27.110 --> 26:28.320
As for you,

26:28.440 --> 26:30.480
don't keep listening to all that gossip.

26:30.480 --> 26:31.920
It's all just for show.

26:32.920 --> 26:34.270
Only a fool would believe it.

26:34.270 --> 26:36.070
I'm not a fool.

26:36.700 --> 26:37.940
Although I said that to you,

26:37.940 --> 26:39.400
I don't really believe it.

26:39.550 --> 26:40.960
I told Heizi

26:41.000 --> 26:42.750
that if you were a person chasing wealth,

26:42.750 --> 26:44.680
you would have stayed on the grasslands.

26:44.680 --> 26:45.270
I...

26:48.310 --> 26:50.270
I'm just anxious.

26:52.510 --> 26:53.160
Alright.

26:53.750 --> 26:55.080
Stop talking nonsense.

26:55.240 --> 26:56.770
Didn't I tell you last time?

26:56.790 --> 26:57.550
Wang Tiangui asked me

26:57.550 --> 26:59.030
to complete two tasks for him.

26:59.030 --> 27:01.760
Only when they're done
will he release Mr. Chang.

27:05.720 --> 27:06.920
Someone's upstairs.

27:08.680 --> 27:10.590
You keep saying the same thing
over and over.

27:10.590 --> 27:12.060
Get lost, Gu!

27:12.270 --> 27:13.240
What?

27:16.880 --> 27:17.590
It's so cold today.

27:17.590 --> 27:18.310
Keep it for yourself

27:18.310 --> 27:19.770
so you can live a long life!

27:21.240 --> 27:22.820
You ungrateful thing!

27:23.000 --> 27:23.790
Get lost!

28:16.230 --> 28:18.030
This was given to me by a Russian.

28:26.310 --> 28:26.960
This...

28:27.310 --> 28:28.070
This... this...

28:28.070 --> 28:29.310
What's with all this stammering?

28:29.310 --> 28:31.200
You, a young master, have no clue

28:31.220 --> 28:32.590
about doing a thief's job.

28:32.590 --> 28:34.790
Someone's been sitting here for ages,

28:34.880 --> 28:36.410
and you didn't even notice.

28:37.030 --> 28:38.540
I wasn't born to be a thief.

28:38.960 --> 28:40.030
I'm just curious.

28:41.550 --> 28:42.350
Curious?

28:43.560 --> 28:44.890
What do you want to know?

28:50.680 --> 28:52.160
Was it you who sent those dozens of people

28:52.160 --> 28:53.240
over there?

28:54.030 --> 28:55.890
To the south of the Yangtze River?

28:56.680 --> 28:58.590
You really are a rebel?

29:00.160 --> 29:02.290
Didn't you already know that? Why ask?

29:02.350 --> 29:04.280
And my father still listens to you?

29:04.400 --> 29:05.480
Doesn't he know that dealing with

29:05.480 --> 29:05.920
someone like you

29:05.920 --> 29:07.680
could get our whole family executed?

29:07.680 --> 29:08.830
Well said.

29:09.400 --> 29:10.880
You truly are a filial son.

29:13.750 --> 29:15.270
Shouldn't you ask your father

29:15.270 --> 29:16.880
why he listens to me?

29:17.110 --> 29:18.750
Why are you here interrogating me?

29:18.750 --> 29:19.350
Yes.

29:19.590 --> 29:20.880
Of course I'll ask him.

29:21.270 --> 29:22.730
But I want to ask you first.

29:22.960 --> 29:24.160
You must know the reason.

29:24.160 --> 29:25.240
Of course I do.

29:27.720 --> 29:28.400
But your father

29:28.400 --> 29:29.660
told me not to tell you.

29:30.110 --> 29:31.640
He said you're just a child.

29:42.790 --> 29:44.280
You want to know

29:44.310 --> 29:45.970
why I came to Pingyao with you?

29:47.400 --> 29:48.400
Now you know.

29:49.090 --> 29:50.350
I have my own business.

29:50.960 --> 29:51.650
You should

29:51.680 --> 29:53.640
just do your job as the young master.

29:53.640 --> 29:54.680
Don't cause trouble.

29:54.680 --> 29:56.540
Before we left, I told your father

29:56.920 --> 29:59.610
it didn't matter
whether you could make a profit or not.

29:59.610 --> 30:02.200
If you lose, just see it as a joke.

30:03.110 --> 30:04.690
The bigger the joke,

30:04.790 --> 30:06.790
the better it works as a cover for me.

30:07.550 --> 30:08.630
No wonder.

30:08.790 --> 30:09.830
Of course.

30:10.440 --> 30:11.790
If it weren't for you
stirring things up here

30:11.790 --> 30:13.790
and drawing everyone's attention,

30:13.830 --> 30:15.160
gathering all those people

30:15.160 --> 30:17.090
would have made me too suspicious.

30:17.240 --> 30:17.960
Come to think of it,

30:17.960 --> 30:19.690
you made a great contribution.

30:20.000 --> 30:21.240
If we get a chance to go to the south,

30:21.240 --> 30:23.370
I'll make sure to reward you properly.

30:23.830 --> 30:25.400
You've finished your business.

30:25.400 --> 30:26.310
Now leave.

30:26.830 --> 30:28.590
My father is extremely wealthy.

30:28.590 --> 30:30.160
Even if he owed you any favors,

30:30.160 --> 30:31.640
they should be repaid by now.

30:31.640 --> 30:32.240
Go.

30:34.720 --> 30:36.310
You're quite amusing, kid.

30:37.030 --> 30:39.360
There's no way
I'd ever let your father go—

30:40.160 --> 30:42.400
and now I won't let you go either.

31:01.880 --> 31:04.310
You really think
I wouldn't dare pull the trigger?

31:04.310 --> 31:05.680
If you're going to do it,

31:05.750 --> 31:07.880
at least choose something that works.

31:08.550 --> 31:10.150
This is a gift from my friend.

31:10.240 --> 31:11.570
It's never been loaded.

31:12.200 --> 31:13.160
Every time I play with it,

31:13.160 --> 31:14.750
I polish it carefully for hours.

31:14.750 --> 31:15.480
Put it away.

31:16.110 --> 31:18.530
You're holding it so carelessly.

31:18.640 --> 31:20.770
Aren't you afraid it'll hurt my heart?

31:20.870 --> 31:21.530
Put it back.

31:31.200 --> 31:32.460
You just won't listen.

31:34.430 --> 31:35.350
Seriously.

31:36.510 --> 31:38.040
You've gotten it all dirty.

31:41.160 --> 31:44.090
There's no bullets in it.
Who are you trying to scare?

31:56.590 --> 31:57.720
Next time you enter my room,

31:57.720 --> 31:59.380
I'll put a bullet in your head.

31:59.680 --> 32:00.400
Get out.

32:11.680 --> 32:12.480
Stop.

32:13.510 --> 32:14.790
Tomorrow, bring more men

32:14.790 --> 32:15.830
and get the carriages and horses ready.

32:15.830 --> 32:17.490
We're going to Jinyang Villa.

32:18.000 --> 32:19.400
The Kang family
of the Eight Families of Hedong

32:19.400 --> 32:20.750
is selling their property.

32:20.750 --> 32:22.150
I'm determined to get it.

32:23.270 --> 32:25.100
And tell your friend

32:25.160 --> 32:26.830
that if he doesn't want to be
sent back to Ningguta,

32:26.830 --> 32:28.890
he'd better not cause trouble for me.

32:38.450 --> 32:44.950
[Jinyang Villa]

32:55.920 --> 32:57.200
Excuse me, are First Master Jin
and First Madam Jin

32:57.200 --> 32:57.790
at home?

32:57.880 --> 32:59.200
I'm the manager of Taiyufeng.

32:59.200 --> 33:00.310
My name is Gu Pingyuan.

33:00.310 --> 33:01.200
This is my calling card.

33:00.460 --> 33:02.870
[The Eight Families of Hedong,
First Madam Jin]

33:05.200 --> 33:07.260
The manager of Taiyufeng is so young.

33:08.720 --> 33:09.720
That old dog Wang Tiangui

33:09.720 --> 33:10.880
must be blind.

33:14.480 --> 33:16.680
Could you please deliver my card?

33:17.070 --> 33:18.200
I am First Madam Jin.

33:19.880 --> 33:20.340
Come in.

33:21.680 --> 33:22.550
I've heard so much about you.

33:22.550 --> 33:23.950
It's an honor seeing you.

33:36.740 --> 33:37.590
Manager Gu,

33:37.960 --> 33:39.060
please have a seat.

33:39.270 --> 33:41.160
I'll attend to my husband
while he takes his medicine

33:41.160 --> 33:42.960
and then come back to talk to you.

34:12.150 --> 34:14.080
So you like stones too, Manager Gu?

34:16.630 --> 34:18.190
They have a certain rustic charm.

34:18.190 --> 34:18.670
Do you know

34:18.670 --> 34:20.270
the history of these stones?

34:20.880 --> 34:22.139
They're Taihu stones,

34:22.440 --> 34:24.100
transported from Taihu Lake.

34:25.800 --> 34:26.600
Partly right,

34:27.110 --> 34:28.110
and partly wrong.

34:28.760 --> 34:29.480
These

34:30.070 --> 34:31.480
were the stones personally chosen
by Emperor Huizong

34:31.480 --> 34:33.139
of the Northern Song Dynasty.

34:33.190 --> 34:34.480
He gathered rare stones
from all over the land

34:34.480 --> 34:35.880
to be shipped back to Bianjing.

34:35.880 --> 34:36.760
But before the boats arrived,

34:36.760 --> 34:37.760
the dynasty fell.

34:37.770 --> 34:38.920
The boatmen, to save their lives,

34:38.920 --> 34:39.630
dumped all these stones

34:39.630 --> 34:40.670
into the Yangtze River.

34:40.670 --> 34:43.600
And the river
washed over them for hundreds of years.

34:44.190 --> 34:45.790
My husband loves stones too.

34:46.360 --> 34:47.820
He spent five years

34:47.860 --> 34:49.460
having all of them salvaged.

34:51.030 --> 34:52.560
Truly a man of great wealth.

34:53.000 --> 34:54.730
These are national treasures.

34:55.150 --> 34:56.350
National treasures?

34:56.800 --> 34:57.530
If you ask me,

34:58.070 --> 34:58.760
they're nothing but things

34:58.760 --> 35:00.560
that ruin families and nations.

35:01.280 --> 35:02.210
In famine years,

35:02.960 --> 35:05.020
they're not even worth a steamed bun.

35:06.280 --> 35:07.400
Madam,

35:07.800 --> 35:09.530
that's a very insightful view.

35:10.550 --> 35:11.610
Save the flattery.

35:13.000 --> 35:14.600
My husband is in poor health.

35:14.670 --> 35:15.930
Didn't you just see it?

35:16.840 --> 35:17.480
Yes.

35:18.550 --> 35:20.070
I didn't expect he's...

35:20.590 --> 35:22.250
I came at an unfortunate time.

35:23.230 --> 35:24.920
He's been like this since he was young.

35:24.920 --> 35:26.110
He's simply too clever,

35:26.110 --> 35:27.320
too skilled in business,

35:27.320 --> 35:28.440
and he stole heaven's secrets.

35:28.440 --> 35:29.770
At his age, he's already

35:30.320 --> 35:31.670
like a candle flickering in the wind,

35:31.670 --> 35:32.960
a lamp caught in the rain.

35:32.960 --> 35:33.880
He has no son,

35:34.190 --> 35:36.250
and his siblings are a complete mess.

35:36.280 --> 35:38.210
Everything falls on me alone. Sit.

35:41.230 --> 35:42.160
Please sit down.

35:42.480 --> 35:43.680
Let's talk business.

35:46.960 --> 35:49.150
My boss sent me specifically

35:49.360 --> 35:51.070
to pay respects to everyone
from the Eight Families.

35:51.070 --> 35:52.280
He wishes to use his own funds

35:52.280 --> 35:54.280
to buy all of the Kang family's property

35:54.280 --> 35:55.070
and help them

35:55.110 --> 35:56.970
survive their present hardship.

36:00.480 --> 36:01.080
What else?

36:02.960 --> 36:04.360
Our boss also said that

36:04.840 --> 36:06.480
the Eight Families of Hedong
have been prominent

36:06.480 --> 36:09.070
in the Qing Empire's business world
for more than 200 years

36:09.070 --> 36:11.280
and have been leaders among merchants
across the country.

36:11.280 --> 36:12.840
He holds your families
in great admiration.

36:12.840 --> 36:14.000
If he can take this opportunity

36:14.000 --> 36:15.460
to buy out the Kang family,

36:15.510 --> 36:17.240
would you be willing to help him

36:17.670 --> 36:19.360
gain a place among the Eight Families?

36:19.360 --> 36:20.760
It would also be a way

36:20.880 --> 36:22.540
to contribute to the country.

36:25.360 --> 36:26.400
Wang Tiangui

36:26.440 --> 36:28.040
would never say such things.

36:28.480 --> 36:30.110
Mr. Gu, you're an educated man.

36:30.110 --> 36:32.040
These are your words, aren't they?

36:33.440 --> 36:34.190
Yes.

36:35.230 --> 36:36.590
It's polite talk,

36:37.320 --> 36:39.120
but it's also truly what I think.

36:42.010 --> 36:43.360
The Eight Families?

36:45.150 --> 36:46.350
What Eight Families?

36:46.920 --> 36:49.120
We've long been scattered to the winds.

36:50.590 --> 36:52.550
Master Sun
from Sun family in southern Shanxi

36:52.550 --> 36:53.840
and the Li family in northern Shanxi—

36:53.840 --> 36:54.800
they all have more influence

36:54.800 --> 36:55.930
than our Jin family.

36:56.880 --> 36:57.400
But...

37:09.510 --> 37:11.450
Meeting you today

37:11.510 --> 37:12.910
is already a great honor.

37:13.230 --> 37:13.920
Since that's the case,

37:13.920 --> 37:15.320
I won't trouble you further.

37:15.320 --> 37:16.580
I'll take my leave now.

37:32.280 --> 37:33.760
I, Gu Pingyuan, Manager of Taiyufeng,

37:33.760 --> 37:35.700
am here to pay my respects to you, Mr. Li.

37:34.990 --> 37:36.660
[The Eight Families of Hedong,
Li Zhongdeng]

37:35.840 --> 37:36.300
Please.

37:55.030 --> 37:55.960
Fujian rock tea?

37:56.340 --> 37:58.320
It really is the finest tea in the world.

37:58.320 --> 37:59.020
You know tea?

37:59.020 --> 38:03.080
[Beauty of Spring]

37:59.280 --> 38:00.280
I'm from Huizhou.

38:01.030 --> 38:02.880
I grew up in tea fields.

38:03.280 --> 38:05.340
I've sampled a little with my family.

38:05.400 --> 38:07.460
Since you know tea, you're not a fool.

38:08.480 --> 38:09.280
Let me ask you.

38:09.760 --> 38:10.920
What makes you think

38:11.360 --> 38:14.000
that Taiyufeng can enter the Eight Families
of Hedong

38:14.000 --> 38:16.400
just by buying the Kang family's property?

38:16.510 --> 38:17.880
Is Wang Tiangui alone

38:18.440 --> 38:19.640
richer than all of us?

38:19.720 --> 38:20.710
Of course not.

38:21.320 --> 38:22.670
The Eight Families of Hedong

38:22.670 --> 38:24.730
have always looked after each other.

38:24.800 --> 38:27.400
Why would we need outsiders
bringing in money?

38:27.400 --> 38:28.530
Wang Tiangui thinks

38:29.070 --> 38:30.330
he can compete with us,

38:30.400 --> 38:30.950
doesn't he?

38:30.950 --> 38:31.800
No, not at all.

38:31.960 --> 38:32.810
Let me ask you another question.

38:32.810 --> 38:33.510
Mr. Li,

38:33.670 --> 38:35.480
I've long admired your reputation.

38:35.480 --> 38:37.410
I came specially today to meet you.

38:37.710 --> 38:39.230
You're the host and I'm the guest.

38:39.230 --> 38:41.630
Would you allow me to say a few words as well?

38:45.000 --> 38:45.530
Go ahead.

38:46.400 --> 38:47.630
As you said,

38:48.230 --> 38:50.960
the Eight Families have always looked after each other.

38:50.960 --> 38:52.920
The other seven families are wealthy beyond measure.

38:52.920 --> 38:54.280
They could easily spare a fraction of their wealth

38:54.280 --> 38:55.920
to cover the deficit the Kang family is facing.

38:55.920 --> 38:56.630
So why has the Kang family

38:56.630 --> 38:58.490
been forced to sell its property?

39:00.190 --> 39:01.070
But anyway,

39:01.440 --> 39:02.550
Taiyufeng

39:02.670 --> 39:04.770
is the wealthiest household in Pingyao.

39:04.770 --> 39:06.230
Even if we join the Eight Families,

39:06.230 --> 39:08.490
at least we wouldn't bring you any shame.

39:08.960 --> 39:10.680
Yet Madam Jin spoke vaguely,

39:10.800 --> 39:11.710
and you turned me away

39:11.710 --> 39:12.840
outright.

39:13.030 --> 39:14.510
Has our boss

39:14.590 --> 39:15.710
offended you somehow?

39:15.710 --> 39:17.120
Or is there something else

39:17.120 --> 39:18.440
behind all this?

39:25.230 --> 39:26.830
That old guy Wang Tiangui...

39:26.840 --> 39:28.370
I never admired him before.

39:28.630 --> 39:29.790
But now I suppose...

39:30.590 --> 39:31.840
I admire him a little.

39:33.110 --> 39:35.200
How did he manage to get someone like you

39:35.200 --> 39:36.230
working for him?

39:39.190 --> 39:40.280
I am Li Zhongdeng.

39:40.880 --> 39:43.080
I'm paying my respects to you this time.

39:44.360 --> 39:44.840
Please.

39:46.430 --> 39:47.070
This way.

39:50.230 --> 39:51.090
Please come in.

40:04.840 --> 40:05.960
Mr. Gu, come.

40:10.310 --> 40:10.960
Ms. Su.

40:12.520 --> 40:14.360
I should have come to pay my respects long ago.

40:14.360 --> 40:15.630
Today I finally meet you.

40:15.630 --> 40:17.890
Why should you pay respects to me, Mr. Gu?

40:20.110 --> 40:21.420
You stirred up

40:21.480 --> 40:23.010
such a commotion in Shanxi.

40:23.280 --> 40:24.670
I'm truly impressed.

40:26.110 --> 40:27.110
If it weren't

40:27.110 --> 40:28.630
for your clever tricks

40:29.110 --> 40:30.170
making the merchants of Pingyao

40:30.170 --> 40:31.640
fall ill,

40:32.150 --> 40:34.750
I wouldn't have had my hands free to do all this.

40:35.000 --> 40:36.000
In a sense,

40:36.510 --> 40:37.790
I ought to thank you.

40:40.440 --> 40:41.100
Have a seat.

40:41.400 --> 40:42.730
Let's sit down and talk.

40:45.110 --> 40:47.480
Wang Tiangui is determined to succeed this time.

40:47.480 --> 40:48.610
If you want to buy it,

40:48.840 --> 40:50.170
please give me a chance.

40:50.810 --> 40:51.870
We're brothers.

40:51.960 --> 40:53.760
Of course I can give you a chance.

40:54.030 --> 40:55.890
But she's the one who's buying it.

41:02.030 --> 41:02.670
Kang,

41:03.510 --> 41:04.640
explain to everyone

41:05.280 --> 41:07.150
why you insisted on sending out notices

41:07.150 --> 41:08.480
to wealthy merchants across the country

41:08.480 --> 41:09.400
to buy your family's property.

41:09.400 --> 41:11.110
[The Eight Families of Hedong, Jin Wencai]

41:11.210 --> 41:12.910
[The Eight Families of Hedong, Kang Suyuan]

41:11.360 --> 41:13.230
There are no outsiders here today.

41:13.230 --> 41:14.510
Make it clear to us.

41:15.000 --> 41:16.730
If you can't explain yourself,

41:17.400 --> 41:18.860
don't even think about leaving this room.

41:18.860 --> 41:20.290
[The Eight Families of Hedong, Sun Yucheng]

41:25.110 --> 41:26.480
Rumors have been spreading

41:26.480 --> 41:27.190
that the Eight Families

41:27.190 --> 41:29.050
are guarding King Li's Treasure,

41:29.440 --> 41:30.030
and the stories

41:30.030 --> 41:32.090
have grown more and more outrageous.

41:32.240 --> 41:32.880
The imperial court

41:32.880 --> 41:34.230
is now watching us.

41:35.240 --> 41:37.840
They can't raise funds for the war in the south.

41:38.030 --> 41:39.320
This time our family was transporting

41:39.320 --> 41:40.900
His Highness's military supplies,

41:40.900 --> 41:41.800
and somehow

41:41.840 --> 41:43.770
a big fire burned everything down.

41:44.400 --> 41:45.570
Our opponent is clearly keeping an eye

41:45.570 --> 41:47.630
on how much property our family owns.

41:49.400 --> 41:50.360
If I quietly

41:50.400 --> 41:51.430
use your money

41:51.800 --> 41:52.660
to repay it,

41:52.920 --> 41:53.920
the imperial court's suspicions

41:53.920 --> 41:55.150
will be confirmed.

41:57.070 --> 41:57.760
Everyone,

41:58.760 --> 42:01.160
if the Kang family doesn't go bankrupt now,

42:02.000 --> 42:03.360
the Eight Families

42:03.400 --> 42:04.730
will truly be finished.

42:05.670 --> 42:06.730
The imperial court

42:06.760 --> 42:08.560
will definitely strike us hard.

42:08.590 --> 42:10.280
I might as well sell everything

42:10.280 --> 42:11.440
and go home to look after my children and tend the land,

42:11.440 --> 42:12.320
which would be much easier.

42:12.320 --> 42:13.380
Don't you think so?

42:28.440 --> 42:29.550
That makes sense.

42:31.190 --> 42:32.790
You've suffered a lot, Kang.

42:33.440 --> 42:34.710
Here, get up first.

42:36.840 --> 42:37.590
Kang,

42:38.150 --> 42:39.550
this isn't the right way.

42:40.190 --> 42:41.340
Do you think that if you sacrifice your family to ease the trouble,

42:41.340 --> 42:43.470
the imperial court won't suspect you?

42:43.590 --> 42:44.590
Not necessarily.

42:44.590 --> 42:45.550
Can't you see?

42:46.320 --> 42:47.320
Everyone outside

42:47.400 --> 42:48.510
is only after

42:48.530 --> 42:49.910
King Li's Treasure.

42:50.510 --> 42:52.760
Buying the Kang family's property is just an excuse.

42:52.760 --> 42:54.000
Their real goal is to get into the Eight Families

42:54.000 --> 42:55.890
and find out

42:55.920 --> 42:57.110
where the treasure is.

42:57.110 --> 42:58.240
Then let them buy it.

42:58.800 --> 43:00.150
Once they do,

43:00.550 --> 43:02.000
they'll realize

43:02.030 --> 43:03.250
it's not like it seems.
